  "id": "ehr",
  "term": "EHR",
  "definition": "EHR refers to patient health information recorded in routine care, mainly as a documentation and billing tool rather than a system designed for long-term research. It can include both structured entries and unstructured notes, and its use in research can be limited by missing, inconsistent, or nonrepresentative data.",
